{
  "esm": "1.3.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "mom6_ppm_edge",
    "description": "One raw edge of the MOM6 PPM parabola (PPM_reconstruction_x, MOM_continuity_PPM.F90:2428-2449), shared by the left and right edges of a cell: edge = 0.5*(h_side_masked + h_0) + (slp_side - slp_0)/6 with h_side_masked = m_side*h_side + (1 - m_side)*h_0 (a masked neighbor is replaced by the cell's own thickness, the Fortran's h_im1/h_ip1 masked replacement at F90:2430-2431 and 2441-2442). The caller binds the two edges with swapped slope roles: the LEFT edge binds slp_side to the west neighbor's slope and slp_0 to the cell's own (hL = 0.5*(h_im1 + h_0) + oneSixth*(slp(i-1) - slp(i))), the RIGHT edge binds slp_side to the cell's own slope and slp_0 to the east neighbor's (hR = 0.5*(h_ip1 + h_0) + oneSixth*(slp(i) - slp(i+1))). One law, both edges; the un-limited (raw) edge feeds mom6_ppm_limit_scale. Pure scalar algebra, [m].",
    "license": "MIT",
    "tags": ["esd:stencil", "family:mom6_cgrid", "grid:mom6_cgrid", "op:reconstruct"],
    "references": [
      {
        "citation": "Colella, P., & Woodward, P. R. (1984). The Piecewise Parabolic Method (PPM) for gas-dynamical simulations. Journal of Computational Physics, 54(1), 174-201. (Eq. 1.6, the edge interpolation.)",
        "doi": "10.1016/0021-9991(84)90143-8"
      }
    ]
  },
  "expression_templates": {
    "mom6_ppm_edge": {
      "params": ["h_side", "h_0", "slp_side", "slp_0", "m_side"],
      "description": "One raw PPM edge of a cell (MOM_continuity_PPM.F90:2428-2449), left or right by the caller's slope bindings",
      "body": {
        "op": "+",
        "args": [
          {
            "op": "*",
            "args": [
              0.5,
              {
                "op": "+",
                "args": [
                  {
                    "op": "+",
                    "args": [
                      { "op": "*", "args": ["m_side", "h_side"] },
                      { "op": "*", "args": [{ "op": "-", "args": [1.0, "m_side"] }, "h_0"] }
                    ]
                  },
                  "h_0"
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "op": "*",
            "args": [
              { "op": "/", "args": [1.0, 6.0] },
              { "op": "-", "args": ["slp_side", "slp_0"] }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  }
}
